# 个人 tier 占位 — knowledge/personal/

Phase 2 plan 02-02: the personal tier is intentionally empty.

The contact-info query (spike 002/003 query 5) targets this tier
("张总的电话是多少"), but the compliance Skill reads=[authority/**]
only — so the retriever never queries 个人. Even an out-of-scope
direct query against personal/ returns 0 results here, which the
pipeline (plan 02-03) correctly maps to no_authorized_source
refusal (SC-2 / SC-4).

The directory is kept in git (via this .gitkeep) so the four-tier
structure that D-07 + D2-12 mandate survives clones.